# Cloudflare Pages redirects config.
# Reference: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# Without these, requesting a category or static page without its
# canonical trailing slash / .html extension fell through to Cloudflare
# Pages' SPA fallback and silently served the homepage as a 200 instead of
# redirecting — Search Console flagged this as a redirect/indexing issue.
# See frontend/404.html (generated by scripts/generate_category_pages.py)
# for the companion fix covering everything that isn't one of these known
# routes (typos, expired deal permalinks, etc.) — those should 404, not
# redirect.

